  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Chain-smoking beedies 'til his brain's broken completely",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Get back on his feet, work out and eat some Wheaties",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Greedy for the cheese, please, most couldn't fathom",
          "rhyme": "Om",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Had him in the cobra clutch, when he spat the mad hymn",
          "rhyme": "yt",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Gems, collection of brrrats, Timbs and hats",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Had no time for the pitty-pat, I'll give him that",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "The rhythm hit him back with a right hook",
          "rhyme": "uk",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Shook it off, caught a shiner, thought it was an aight look",
          "rhyme": "uk",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Depends on the shades",
          "rhyme": "ad",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "The end of days fades, pretenders lay",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "In dazes on stages, DOO-Malaise",
          "rhyme": "Ez",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Eat it up, microphone, microwave mayonnaise",
          "rhyme": "Ez",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "His own way was strange but it matters not",
          "rhyme": "Ot",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Tuned into a frequency tone that shattered rock",
          "rhyme": "Ok",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Hold it down like Shatner do Spock",
          "rhyme": "Ok",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Rapper jocks need to put a sock in they chatterbox",
          "rhyme": "Oks",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "The block got light of Vioxx stock",
          "rhyme": "Ok",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "Folks gather round, it's no joke like \"Knock, knock\"",
          "rhyme": "Ok",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "It's them, they came home to roost y'all",
          "rhyme": "ol",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "And watch 'em transform the game to the rules of foosball",
          "rhyme": "ol",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "She's too small, any questions?",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "Him could squeeze blood from a penny in the recession",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "Keep guessing, it gets deeper than depression",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "The power of suggestion wake a sleeper, peep the lesson",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "Dig that beat",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "Ripped it with Metal Fingers and stomped it with big fat feet",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "And you know what they say, cut the hay",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "Resistance is futile, you will be assimilated, but today",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "28",
          "text": "It's all grey, metallic with a ruby stone",
          "rhyme": "on",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "29",
          "text": "Rude like the type of dude you could write a movie on",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "30",
          "text": "Hardcore porn, did his own stunts",
          "rhyme": "(",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "31",
          "text": "Writ his own rhymes and split his own blunts",
          "rhyme": "(",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "32",
          "text": "Once, in a while, every other minute",
          "rhyme": "yt",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "33",
          "text": "Eyes pop out, Popeye, heavy on the spinach",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "34",
          "text": "Steady on his business and ready with an ill pitch",
          "rhyme": "itS",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "35",
          "text": "Keeps a bad bilznitch like Denny Kucinilznich",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "36",
          "text": "No hitch, just a shit-load of spit and sneeze",
          "rhyme": "iz",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "37",
          "text": "Strictly G stacking up off a rack of hidden fees",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "38",
          "text": "Rap is like the gay club strip tease",
          "rhyme": "iz",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "39",
          "text": "With hippies on the yip saying, \"Hey bub, grip these\"",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "40",
          "text": "They screaming for attention",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "41",
          "text": "Beaming at the mention of a scary demon convention",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "42",
          "text": "You could cut the tension with a switchblade",
          "rhyme": "ad",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "43",
          "text": "And serve it on the same plate of hors d'oeuvres a witch made",
          "rhyme": "ad",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "44",
          "text": "Filleted, persuaded the chambermaid",
          "rhyme": "Ed",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "45",
          "text": "To bet her paycheck on a get-naked game of spades",
          "rhyme": "ad",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "46",
          "text": "Straight up, no chaser, no layaways",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "47",
          "text": "Caution, faint taste of microwave mayonnaise",
          "rhyme": "Ez",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
